#: docs/content-types.md:29
msgid "folio-assistant is content-agnostic: the platform knows nothing about any particular paper or guideline. Each kind of content is supported by a content adapter (code that knows how to validate/build/render that kind) and a skill package (the authoring formalism — what an author and the LLM do)."
msgstr "folio-assistant 是与内容无关的：该平台对任何特定的论文或指南一无所知。每一种（kind）内容都由一个内容适配器（content adapter，懂得如何验证/构建/渲染该种内容的代码）和一个技能包（skill package，创作形式化体系——作者与大语言模型所做的工作）提供支持。"

#: docs/content-types.md:34
msgid "This page describes the formalism of each content type. It is intentionally kept separate from any concrete content; concrete artifacts live in their own content repository."
msgstr "本页面描述了每种内容类型的形式化体系（formalism）。它特意与任何具体内容保持独立；具体的制品存放在它们各自的内容仓库中。"

