#: docs/content-types.md:124
msgid "A recommendation, requirement or rule is the block readers cite and implementers trace to. It wants a label, a stable identity and a place in the dependency graph — everything a  has — and it is emphatically not a theorem, because nothing proves it."
msgstr "建议、要求或规则是读者所引述、实施者所追踪的块。它需要标签、稳定的标识以及在依赖图中的位置——（定理）所拥有的一切——但它断然不是定理，因为没有任何东西去证明它。"

#: docs/content-types.md:129
msgid "There is no first-class  block kind. Today the carrier is a  block with a label and a title; the  skill states the convention and its limits. Earlier guidance in  mapped guideline recommendations onto  — that predates this content type and is wrong for a document folio, where  is a math kind whose  field is required."
msgstr "目前不存在作为一等公民的  块类型。目前它的载体是一个带有标签和标题的  块； 技能阐明了该约定及其限制。早期在  中的指导意见将指南建议映射到  上——这早于当前这种内容类型，并且对文档 folio 而言是错误的，因为在文档 folio 中  属于数学类型，且其  字段是必填项。"

