#: docs/content-types.md:185
msgid "Two of those rows are worth a second look.  is the sharpest point of the whole split — it is the one kind whose  field is required rather than optional, so a document folio could not hold one even if the profile allowed it. And the  kinds still declare an optional : the type permits what the profile forbids, which is why  has a second rule beyond \"is this kind allowed\"."
msgstr "其中有两行值得进一步审视。 是整个划分中最明确的分水岭——它是唯一一个其  字段为必需而非可选的类型，因此即便配置文件允许，文档 folio 也无法容纳它。而“共享”（）类型仍然声明了一个可选的 ：类型系统允许了配置文件所禁止的内容，这正是为什么  在“该类型是否被允许”之外还有第二条规则。"

